OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKyiv resident describes shock at false
OL,4,A'radiation' alerts as Ukraine and
OL,5,ARussia say emergency apps hacked
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine and Russia say their emergency
OL,8,Falert apps have been hit by
OL,9,Fcyber-attacks - what we know in 100
OL,10,Fwords
OL,12,FIn Ukraine, residents saw warnings
OL,13,Fincluding one for a "chemical threat"
OL,14,Fand another for "street fights"
OL,16,FOlena, who lives in Kyiv, tells BBC
OL,17,FRadio 4's Today programme her "first
OL,18,Fthought" after seeing the alerts was:
OL,19,F"I'm prepared for blackouts, for a cut
OL,20,Fin central heating and water supply,
OL,21,Fbut not for a nuclear attack"
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
