OL,3,AKyiv resident describes shock at false
OL,4,A'radiation' alerts as Ukraine and
OL,5,ARussia say emergency apps hacked
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe air force went on to clarify there
OL,8,Fwas no imminent threat of nuclear war,
OL,9,Fblaming Russian interference, writes
OL,10,Four correspondent in Kyiv
OL,12,FLater, Russia itself said a "massive
OL,13,Fcyber-attack" had affected its app,
OL,14,Fwith the emergencies ministry saying
OL,15,Fspecialists were working to restore it
OL,17,FMeanwhile, strikes were reported
OL,18,Fovernight in both countries, with four
OL,19,Fpeople injured in the Ukrainian city of
OL,20,FOdesa and Russia saying drone strikes
OL,21,Fhit an industrial complex east of
OL,22,FMoscow
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
